Name "Plants(IF)"

--Industrial Foregoing 水培槽自动化

--命名规则:
--Plants: 水培槽
--Energy: 终极能量立方
--Water: 水源(推荐使用水槽)
--Ether_Gas: 以太气体储罐
--Storage: 产物存储容器(推荐使用抽屉的存储管理器作为输入)

--能量输送
Every 1 tick do

    Input FE:: From Energy Top Side
        Output FE:: To each Plants Bottom Side

End

--水与以太气体的输送
Every 20 ticks do

    Input fluid:minecraft:water From Water Top Side
        Output fluid:minecraft:water To each Plants Bottom Side
    forget

    Input fluid:industrialforegoing:ether_gas From Ether_Gas Top Side
        Output fluid:industrialforegoing:ether_gas To each Plants Bottom Side
    forget

End

--植物产物输出到存储容器中(推荐抽屉联动)
Every 20 ticks do

    Input From each Plants Top Side Slots 2-16
        Output To Storage Bottom Side
    forget

End